ed logistics, and engaged with diverse audiences to ensure successful execution.\n\nAcross his experiences, he has developed skills in event operations, program coordination, leadership, communication, and community engagement. He is continuing to build toward a career in athletic administration and sports operations, with a focus on the business and organizational aspects that drive success in the sports industry.",
